Package: starc
Title: A Provider-Agnostic STAC Reference Cache
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2471-7511"))
Description: Harvests SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog (STAC) discovery
    results into an append-only Parquet reference store: queries,
    acquisitions, products, and assets as separate levels, with all
    asset references recorded verbatim and no fixed band vocabulary.
    Markers and coverage are derived views, never stored state. Stores
    references, never pixels.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
